  "result": "Fixed in three files; I did not run the test suite.\n\n- `src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts`: `updateOrg` unioned the incoming override list with the stored one, so removing a flag never stuck. A provided list now replaces the stored list, and omitting it keeps the stored list.\n- `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts`: `toggleFlag` only rejected non-overridable flags that were not plan-gated, so `webhooks` could be stored on a Free workspace. It now rejects any flag that is not `overridable`.\n- `src/lib/feature-flags.ts`: `isEnabled` honours a stored override only when the flag is `overridable`, so a stored override on a non-overridable flag has no effect.",
